    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nWhat is/was the traditional treatment for Hepatitis C?\n\n(1) Interferon-α\n(2) Ribavirin\n\n(However treatment is changing quickly with new protease and polymerase inhibitors)\n\n[Image: 1b0a30dbc7fd0dd38cccf632e4d19ccbde8b8faebe86b9388b4b2b1dfcb86ac8]\n\n[Image: be5cbed77ee2fe84b75c7b1dc12242c7c3b9ca83c3785608c3abcaacb4a1895f]\n\n[Image: 3ab50e554cc96f29eec731f5ded53fdcaeb27451b6b1af972ebe0c3c020caf7a]\n\n[Image: 849fbe1b768254647537073d39df6f95a1b4ebb8521ae2eafc3fcdd7aadef9f4]\n\n7.2 - Ribavirin, sofosbuvir, simeprevir\n[Image: cec75d06164c5d181af4a1b564399151ed9464a1dd52468038485986260130b1]\n\n[Image: 27a1a2a494f8ed1232a2676a9f910c0b0a6f703d36d4f91ecae38ec2913ed1dc]\n\n[Image: c6766548cc9f370dcb2ec69ae5b8a1fda6c7197e8ef402d03f1829d514bd1f81]\n\u001b\u001b",
